### Variables : identifiants IAM / jetons réels ; remplacer les UUID retournés
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/planning
@practitioner = 1
@site = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_LOCATION_ID
@doctorToken = REPLACE_WITH_DOCTOR_JWT
@patientToken = REPLACE_WITH_PATIENT_JWT

### Ouvrir mon agenda
POST {{base}}/agenda
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Générer des matinées (adapter les dates futures ; site = lieu créé via /api/v1/locations)
POST {{base}}/agenda/patterns
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"2026-11-02","until":"2026-11-06","zone":"Indian/Antananarivo","weekdays":["MONDAY","WEDNESDAY","FRIDAY"],"dayOfMonth":null,"opening":"09:00","closing":"12:00","site":"{{site}}","type":"NORMAL","audience":"ALL","pathology":null,"multiplier":1}

### Disponibilités consolidées (ou &site=cabinet-a)
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/availability?from=2026-11-02T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-07T00:00:00Z&firstAvailable=true
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Réserver : utiliser le slot retourné ci-dessus
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot":"REPLACE_WITH_SLOT_UUID","firstVisit":false,"intake":{"beneficiary":"Moi","reason":"Suivi","symptoms":null,"questionnaire":{},"documents":[],"teleconsultationConsent":false,"communication":"EMAIL"}}

### Mes RDV (le praticien voit tous les siens)
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Détail complet privé
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments/REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Export calendrier (pas une synchronisation)
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments/REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_UUID/calendar
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Report atomique
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments/REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_UUID/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot":"REPLACE_WITH_NEW_SLOT_UUID","firstVisit":false}

### Annuler
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments/REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_UUID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Indisponible"}

### Check-in (H−1 au plus tôt)
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments/REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_UUID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CHECKED_IN"}

### Appel praticien (puis COMPLETED)
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/appointments/REPLACE_WITH_APPOINTMENT_UUID/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CALLED"}

### Ma position / estimation
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Liste d'attente si aucune disponibilité dans l'intervalle
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/waiting-list
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"2026-11-02T00:00:00Z","to":"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z","site":"{{site}}","type":"NORMAL","urgent":false,"automaticOffer":true,"communication":"IN_APP"}

### Candidats classés, accessibles seulement au praticien propriétaire
GET {{base}}/agenda/slots/REPLACE_WITH_SLOT_UUID/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Attribution manuelle (même corps que la réservation)
POST {{base}}/agenda/waiting-list/REPLACE_WITH_WAITING_UUID/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slot":"REPLACE_WITH_SLOT_UUID","firstVisit":false,"intake":{"beneficiary":"Patient","reason":"Suivi","symptoms":null,"questionnaire":{},"documents":[],"teleconsultationConsent":false,"communication":"EMAIL"}}

### Quitter la liste
DELETE {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/waiting-list/me
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}


### Enregistrer un modèle nommé (ne crée pas encore les créneaux)
PUT {{base}}/agenda/templates/matinees
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"2026-12-01","until":"2026-12-07","zone":"Indian/Antananarivo","weekdays":["MONDAY","WEDNESDAY"],"dayOfMonth":null,"opening":"09:00","closing":"12:00","site":"{{site}}","type":"NORMAL","audience":"ALL","pathology":null,"multiplier":1}

### Appliquer à une autre période (échec atomique s'il y a un conflit)
POST {{base}}/agenda/templates/matinees/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"2026-12-14","until":"2026-12-20"}

### Dupliquer une période, décalage en jours UTC
POST {{base}}/agenda/duplicate
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"from":"2026-12-14T00:00:00Z","to":"2026-12-21T00:00:00Z","shiftDays":7}

### Motif et questions obligatoires : intake.reason doit ensuite valoir "suivi"
PUT {{base}}/agenda/reasons/suivi
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"suivi","label":"Consultation de suivi","type":"NORMAL","minutes":30,"requiredQuestions":["allergies"],"documents":["Ordonnance actuelle"]}

### Motifs disponibles
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/reasons
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Fermer une plage libre (refus si un RDV/proposition y est rattaché)
POST {{base}}/agenda/closures
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"site":"{{site}}","from":"2026-12-28T06:00:00Z","to":"2026-12-28T09:00:00Z","type":"ABSENCE"}

### Déclarer un retard par site
PUT {{base}}/agenda/delay
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"site":"{{site}}","minutes":20}

### Import ICS strict : événements UTC non récurrents, en plages bloquées
POST {{base}}/agenda/import?site={{site}}
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: text/calendar

BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:formation-20261229
DTSTART:20261229T060000Z
DTEND:20261229T090000Z
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR

### Mes propositions temporaires privées
GET {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/waiting-list/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Accepter avant expiration, avec le questionnaire et consentement nécessaires
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/waiting-list/offers/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_UUID/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"intake":{"beneficiary":"Moi","reason":"suivi","symptoms":null,"questionnaire":{"allergies":"Aucune"},"documents":[],"teleconsultationConsent":false,"communication":"IN_APP"}}

### Refuser : quitte la liste pour éviter une reproposition en boucle
POST {{base}}/{{practitioner}}/waiting-list/offers/REPLACE_WITH_OFFER_UUID/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Boîte de notifications (in-app toujours disponible, email seulement si configuré/demandé)
GET {{base}}/notifications?page=0&size=25
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Marquer une notification lue
POST {{base}}/notifications/REPLACE_WITH_NOTIFICATION_UUID/read
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Mon journal d'audit, jamais celui d'un autre praticien
GET {{base}}/agenda/audit?page=0&size=25
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
